{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>63歲荷里活鬼才導演昆頓塔倫天奴（Quentin Tarantino）與43歲阿根庭歌手妻子Daniella Pick再為人父母，他們的代表昨日宣布喜訊。</p><p>代表透露Daniella日前為昆頓誕下男嬰，他們於2018年在美國洛杉磯結婚，婚後兩年她為昆頓誕下兒子Leo，而2022年，她再誕下女兒Adriana。昆頓夫婦並未有透露兒子的名字與出生日期。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:48:30.146726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:11:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T02:41:57.439413+00:00","content_hash":"b95fd85cbae7c5751817789112f9f98361a95890a81a17ee0bf46d5cdde8a949","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T02:48:30.146726+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}